    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Featured gameplay:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect fusion of Roguelike and lawn mowing: * * Every adventure is a unique experience, with randomly generated enemies and rewards that will bring you unlimited challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect randomly dropped experience and coins, experience will increase your level, coins will be used to purchase permanent buffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/5d34661272d5b5353d13f2c3b14630f1.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic combat and character growth: Choose one of three random attributes to enhance oneself during leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/642b80e046b87bf1df8f289360fa2b85.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal partner: Your pet dog will assist you in collecting battlefield resources and issue warnings when powerful bosses appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/a8621e3f4b91b09b7a1e2e78b9d52976.avif?t=1741306990\" width=716 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skill combinations: Upgrade your skills and use a combination of multiple skills to defeat increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/8c25b8b370157c0bec1712ae980d53d6.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a powerful boss: Facing a boss with vastly different abilities, strategy and skills are the key to winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/f23610a08c218c6fe64681c4870eb306.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Growth: Use coins to unlock talents and gems, permanently enhancing your combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/bfb59dd39e9d6560c0579f67e9620993.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenge: Survive in endless enemy attacks and challenge your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Are you ready to face the challenge**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Your choice will determine everything**</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Featured gameplay:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect fusion of Roguelike and lawn mowing: * * Every adventure is a unique experience, with randomly generated enemies and rewards that will bring you unlimited challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect randomly dropped experience and coins, experience will increase your level, coins will be used to purchase permanent buffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/5d34661272d5b5353d13f2c3b14630f1.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic combat and character growth: Choose one of three random attributes to enhance oneself during leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/642b80e046b87bf1df8f289360fa2b85.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal partner: Your pet dog will assist you in collecting battlefield resources and issue warnings when powerful bosses appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/a8621e3f4b91b09b7a1e2e78b9d52976.avif?t=1741306990\" width=716 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skill combinations: Upgrade your skills and use a combination of multiple skills to defeat increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/8c25b8b370157c0bec1712ae980d53d6.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a powerful boss: Facing a boss with vastly different abilities, strategy and skills are the key to winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/f23610a08c218c6fe64681c4870eb306.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Growth: Use coins to unlock talents and gems, permanently enhancing your combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/bfb59dd39e9d6560c0579f67e9620993.avif?t=1741306990\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenge: Survive in endless enemy attacks and challenge your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Are you ready to face the challenge**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Your choice will determine everything**</p>",
